        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("<i>_The children of stone moved forward. Their path — not an easy one — led through intricate corridors deep underground. They did not know light, for it never reached these deep places. The air was cold.</i>"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
