        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("<i>_When the Golden Flame Tribe (as I will henceforth call them) entered tunnels that had once belonged to the bearded race, one of the trolls began to behave quite unusually.</i>"),
